  "confidence": "moderate",
  "decision_summary": "Prediction is pass. The most direct and condition-matched evidence from related molecules, including DAPPD, cladribine, nelarabine/ara-G, fludarabine, and guanosine, supports meaningful CNS access after systemic administration. Negative in-situ perfusion or BUI results come from less similar molecules and are outweighed by direct systemic CSF and brain exposure evidence.",
